load @term/seed/structure/manifold
  find manifold

# An analytic manifold: a manifold whose charts overlap by analytic maps (locally equal to their power series), a
# stronger smoothness than the merely-differentiable. Analyticity is rigid: a function is fixed everywhere by its
# behavior on any small patch. The form carries the underlying manifold; analytic chart compatibility is the added
# condition.
form analytic-manifold
  link manifold, like manifold
